  "contract": "#736: Versatile and Deadly (681052) is two flat SPELLMOD_EFFECT1 (aura 107, misc 3) modifiers. Effect 0 is -3 with class mask word0 0x100, which selects the Beetle Form helper 803216 (SpellFamilyFlags 256; its effect 0 is aura 87 with BasePoints -1 DieSides 1, i.e. 0). Effect 1 is +5 with mask word0 0x400, which selects Spider Form 800841 (SpellFamilyFlags 1024; its effect 0 is aura 31 MOD_INCREASE_SPEED, BasePoints 19 DieSides 1, i.e. 20). The Beetle helper is applied by AscensionVenomancer::Refresh through Cast with the player as caster, and Refresh only rewrites helper effect 1, so effect 0 keeps the modifier. Each form is applied to its own control (without the talent) and its own talent player so nothing but the talent differs."
